Toris Studio includes cloudflared 2026.10.4, distributed under the
accompanying Apache License 2.0. Windows includes the upstream executable.
The macOS executable is compiled from the unmodified pinned upstream source
with Go 1.27.3 (the exact version required by its go.mod) and CGO disabled.
Go 1.27 requires macOS 13 or later, so the publication media tunnel is
available on macOS 13+; the rest of Toris Studio keeps its macOS 12 floor.
Cloudflared is developed by Cloudflare, Inc. and contributors.

Upstream: https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared
Release: https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/releases/tag/2026.10.4
Source commit: dc3b264da64a801bc3a8d5301a6db21401910ad5

The pinned upstream asset/source/toolchain hashes and supported targets are recorded in
manifest.json. macOS application signing may replace the executable's
upstream code signature. Updates to this bundled executable are delivered
through the signed Toris Studio application updater.
